description:
we are seeking a skilled middle devops engineer to join our dynamic team. as a devops engineer, you will play a crucial role in maintaining and enhancing the cloud infrastructure, ensuring the scalability, reliability, and security of the systems. expertise in aws cloud services, kubernetes, and ci/cd pipelines will be instrumental in driving continuous integration and deployment efforts.
**key responsibilities**
------------------------


* infrastructure management:manage and maintain aws cloud infrastructure, including provisioning, configuring, and optimizing resources for scalability and performance;
* kubernetes deployment:deploy, configure, and manage kubernetes clusters to orchestrate containerized applications effectively;
* ci/cd implementation:design, develop, and maintain robust ci/cd pipelines using github actions, gitlab pipelines, jenkins to automate the software delivery process, ensuring rapid and reliable deployments;
* monitoring and troubleshooting:implement monitoring and logging solutions to track system performance, identify issues proactively, and troubleshoot effectively;
* security compliance:ensure compliance with security best practices and industry standards, implementing necessary measures to protect systems and data;
* collaboration:collaborate closely with clients to streamline the software delivery process, optimize workflows, and drive continuous improvement.
**requirements**
----------------


* bachelor’s degree in computer science, engineering, or a related field;
* strong experience working as a devops engineer or similar role, with a focus on aws cloud services;
* proficiency in building and managing ci/cd pipelines using github actions, jenkins, or similar tools;
* in\-depth knowledge of containerization technologies (docker, kubernetes) and container orchestration;
* familiarity with infrastructure as code (iac) tools such as terraform or cloudformation;
* solid understanding of networking concepts, security principles, and best practices;
* excellent problem\-solving skills and attention to detail;
* strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively in a team environment;
* english level – upper intermediate \+, should be able to easily communicate with clients.
**nice\-to\-have**
------------------


* aws certifications such as aws certified devops engineer or aws certified solutions architect associate;
* experience with other cloud platforms (azure, google cloud platform);
* knowledge of scripting languages (python, bash) for automation tasks;
* experience with configuration management tools (ansible, puppet, chef).
**what you get**
----------------


* flexible working hours;
* competitive compensation commensurate with your experience and skills;
* modern technologies, popular on the market;
* not boring english classes;
* interesting customers and projects;
* learning and development opportunities along with aws certification program;
* an excellent team with a friendly atmosphere.
